304	/*
305	 * View transition (D13): the content of each routed screen fades in and rises 10 px when it is
306	 * inserted. Only opacity and transform: the element is focusable and clickable at once, and the
307	 * focus moved to the h1 (ADR-0004) is not delayed. The h1 itself is not animated, so its hero
308	 * band stays still between steps. Disabled with `prefers-reduced-motion`.
309	 */
